FORM S-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: the-statutes-of-arithmetic.
OFF THE RECORD: a library. Libraries are filed, not downloaded: enact
OFF THE RECORD: this once (trial enact examples/the-statutes-of-arithmetic.trial)
OFF THE RECORD: and any case filed afterward may claim its offices with
OFF THE RECORD: INCORPORATE BY REFERENCE the-statutes-of-arithmetic.
OFF THE RECORD: Re-enacting appends a new version; cases keep the
OFF THE RECORD: enactment they incorporated, pinned by construction.

THE OFFICE OF doubling, CONCERNING n.
    REMAND WITH n TIMES 2.

THE OFFICE OF the-greater, CONCERNING a AND b.
    SHOULD a EXCEED b, REMAND WITH a.
    REMAND WITH b.

THE OFFICE OF the-absolute, CONCERNING n.
    SHOULD n FALL SHORT OF 0, REMAND WITH 0 LESS n.
    REMAND WITH n.
